OL,3,AAttacks victim's death 'potentially
OL,4,Apreventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry heard Barnaby had a less
OL,7,Fthan 50% chance of surviving his
OL,8,Finjuries, characterised as "potentially
OL,9,Fpreventable", while Grace and Ian's
OL,10,Fdeaths were "not preventable".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
