OL,3,AThieves who stole four Renoir paintings
OL,4,Aabandoned two in garden as they fled,
OL,5,Asays mayor
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pair of thieves who stole four Renoir
OL,8,Fpaintings from a French museum left two
OL,9,Fin the garden as they fled, the local
OL,10,Fmayor says
OL,12,FAuthorities initially thought only one
OL,13,Fof the paintings had been abandoned
OL,15,FAccording to French media, the four
OL,16,Fstolen paintings were: Portrait of
OL,17,FMadame Pichon (1895); Portrait of
OL,18,FMadame Colonna Romano (1910); Coco
OL,19,FLisant (1905); and Jeune fille au puits
OL,20,F(1886) - see them all here. It's not
OL,21,Fknown which two were abandoned
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
