OL,3,AThieves who stole four Renoir paintings
OL,4,Aabandoned two in garden as they fled,
OL,5,Asays mayor
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe museum's alarm went off at 05:48
OL,8,Flocal time (04:48 BST), with police
OL,9,Farriving five minutes later. The
OL,10,Fthieves have not been caught
OL,12,FEarlier, the mayor's office said the
OL,13,Festimated value of the stolen art was
OL,14,FbB,9m (#7.7m; $10.5m)
OL,16,FThe theft at the Musee Renoir, in
OL,17,FCagnes-sur-Mer on the French Riviera,
OL,18,Ffollows a multi-million euro heist at
OL,19,Fthe Louvre in Paris last year
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
